# Nevatal Cloud API Catalog
# Base URL: https://cloud.nevatal.id/api/v1

GET  /health                      Platform health and hypervisor reachability
POST /auth/register              Register a new developer account
POST /auth/login                 Session authentication & JWT issuance
GET  /auth/me                    Retrieve authenticated user profile

GET  /instances                  List compute instances
POST /instances                  Provision a new KVM virtual machine
GET  /instances/:id              Instance details, IP, and hardware specs
POST /instances/:id/power        Power operations (start, stop, reboot, reset)
POST /instances/:id/resize       Dynamic CPU and RAM resource resizing
GET  /instances/:id/snapshots    List snapshot recovery points
POST /instances/:id/snapshots    Create instant NVMe snapshot
POST /instances/:id/vnc          Generate secure HTML5 noVNC console ticket

GET  /game-servers               List managed game servers
POST /game-servers               Create Minecraft (Java/Bedrock) or Terraria server
GET  /game-servers/:id           Game server live telemetry, players, and metrics
POST /game-servers/:id/power     Control game server daemon execution
POST /game-servers/:id/command   Dispatch in-game console commands

GET  /android                    List Waydroid Android instances
POST /android                    Provision containerized Android environment
GET  /android/:id                Android status, ADB port, and display session
POST /android/:id/session        Create WebRTC interactive touch session
POST /android/:id/adb            Enable or toggle remote ADB network access

GET  /storage/buckets            List S3 object storage buckets
POST /storage/buckets            Create S3 storage bucket
GET  /storage/access-keys        List MinIO access and secret key pairs

GET  /quotas                     User quota limits and active allocations
GET  /mcp/sse                    Model Context Protocol SSE stream endpoint
POST /mcp/messages               Model Context Protocol message dispatch
